% repositories, vendor documentation, consolidated statutes): these have no fixed
% publication date. Where the archive record supplies a real date it is used;
% otherwise `year` carries the ACCESS year, which always equals `urldate`. The year
% on such an entry therefore states when the resource was consulted, not when it
% was created. German statutes are cited in their consolidated form as accessed.

